# PatientFlow API

PatientFlow API is a healthcare workflow API built with .NET 8 and SQL Server. It models patients and encounters using a clean layered architecture, with early FHIR-inspired patient import support.

## Purpose

This project is designed to practice backend healthcare development concepts, including:

- Healthcare-style data modeling
- SQL Server persistence
- EF Core migrations
- DTO-based API contracts
- Service-layer business logic
- FHIR-style resource mapping
- Database constraints and validation
- Swagger-based API testing

## Tech Stack

- .NET 8 Web API
- SQL Server
- EF Core
- Dapper planned
- Docker
- Swagger
- VS Code MSSQL extension

## Architecture

```text
API Layer
  ↓
Application Layer
  ↓
Infrastructure Layer
  ↓
SQL Server